   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Confirming and correcting",
     "texto": [
      "To check whether a detail is correct, the key expression is «Klopt dat?» (Is that correct?). If there is a typo, you say «Dat klopt niet» (that's not right) or «Het is verkeerd» (it is wrong). To politely ask someone to write down the correct detail, you say: «Kunt u dat opschrijven?» (Can you note that down?)."
     ],
